      "answer": 1.2,
      "unit": "Ω",
      "explain": "Y = [1.5 −1; −1 1.5] S，Δ_Y = 1.5² − 1² = 1.25 S²；z11 = y22/Δ_Y = 1.5/1.25 = 1.2 Ω。验算：2–2' 开路时 z11 = Ra ∥ (Rc + Rb) = 2 ∥ 3 = 1.2 Ω。"
    },
    {
      "id": "z12",
      "ask": "z12 = ?",
